      "message": "The proposed implementation will just make *all* the options required, we want to make *one* of them required.\n\nI think we need something like this: https://github.com/openstack/python-openstackclient/blob/master/openstackclient/volume/v2/consistency_group.py#L86-L87\n\nso it\u0027ll probably look like:\n\n  parser \u003d super(MappingPurge, cls).add_argument_parser(subparsers)\n  exclusive_group \u003d parser.add_mutually_exclusive_group(required\u003dTrue)\n  exclusive_group.add_argument(\u0027--all\u0027, default\u003dFalse, action\u003d\u0027store_true\u0027,\n        ...\n  exclusive_group.add_argument(--domain-name, default\u003dNone,\n       ...\n\n and so forth.\n\nAdding the `required\u003dTrue` to the mutually exclusive group means that one of the options in the group will need to be specified.",
